&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:left&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;bookmark=id.gjdgxs&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;_heading=h.30j0zll&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Saadet Partisi Genel Başkanı Mahmut Arıkan&amp;rsquo;ın TBMM Grup Toplantısı Konuşma Metni&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h1 style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#c00000&quot;&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;_Toc214404400&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;B2&amp;ndash;B3 KISMİ G&amp;Ouml;RME ENGELLİLER FUTSAL MİLLİ TAKIMIMIZ&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;S&amp;ouml;zlerime bir tebrik ve teşekk&amp;uuml;rle başlamak istiyorum. B2&amp;ndash;B3 Kısmi G&amp;ouml;rme Engelliler Futsal Milli Takımımız, Antalya&amp;rsquo;da d&amp;uuml;zenlenen turnuvada Japonya&amp;rsquo;yı 4&amp;ndash;0 gibi net bir skorla mağlup ederek D&amp;uuml;nya şampiyonasında 3. oldu.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Bu b&amp;uuml;y&amp;uuml;k başarının mimarı değerli Teknik Direkt&amp;ouml;r&amp;uuml;m&amp;uuml;z Yusuf Tekdemir hocamızı, teknik ekibi ve alın teriyle, y&amp;uuml;rekleriyle m&amp;uuml;cadele eden t&amp;uuml;m sporcularımızı y&amp;uuml;rekten tebrik ediyorum. Kendileriyle Antalya&amp;rsquo;da bir araya geldik.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;G&amp;ouml;rd&amp;uuml;ğ&amp;uuml;m tablo şuydu: İnan&amp;ccedil; var, disiplin var, m&amp;uuml;cadele var, milli ruh var. Başarıda kendiliğinden gelmiş oldu. Bu vesileyle; Hepsine teşekk&amp;uuml;r ediyor, başarılarının daim olmasını diliyorum.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h1 style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#c00000&quot;&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;_Toc214404401&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;

&lt;h1 style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#c00000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;D&amp;Uuml;NYA &amp;Ccedil;OCUK HAKLARI G&amp;Uuml;N&amp;Uuml;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:left&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Her anne babanın en &amp;ccedil;ok &amp;uuml;zerine titrediği varlıkları; g&amp;ouml;z aydınlıkları olan &amp;ccedil;ocuklarıdır. Yarın &amp;ouml;nemli bir g&amp;uuml;n:&amp;nbsp;20 Kasım D&amp;uuml;nya &amp;Ccedil;ocuk Hakları G&amp;uuml;n&amp;uuml;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:left&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&amp;Ccedil;ocukların haklarına dair g&amp;uuml;nler, s&amp;ouml;zleşmeler, bildirgeler, kanunlar kağıt &amp;uuml;zerinde ger&amp;ccedil;ekten m&amp;uuml;kemmeller.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:left&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Ancak &amp;ccedil;ocuklar; savaşların ve &amp;ccedil;atışmaların, sefaletin ve yoksulluğun kurbanları olmaya devam ediyorlar.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:left&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Bug&amp;uuml;n &amp;ccedil;ocuk hakları ihlali; 77 yıldır Filistin topraklarında işgalci olan İsrail&amp;rsquo;in uzmanlık alanıdır.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:left&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;D&amp;uuml;nya &amp;Ccedil;ocuk Hakları G&amp;uuml;n&amp;uuml;&amp;rsquo;ne dair konuşmalar, programlar, t&amp;ouml;renler yapıp; İsrail&amp;rsquo;in uzmanlaşmış &amp;ccedil;ocuk katili oluşuna dair&amp;nbsp;tek bir c&amp;uuml;mle kurmamak&amp;nbsp;ikiy&amp;uuml;zl&amp;uuml;l&amp;uuml;ğ&amp;uuml;n tescillenmiş fotoğrafıdır.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:left&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h1 style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#c00000&quot;&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;_Toc214404402&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;T&amp;Uuml;RKİYE&amp;rsquo;NİN KARNESİ&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:left&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&amp;Ouml;te yandan; T&amp;uuml;rkiye&amp;rsquo;nin &amp;ccedil;ocuklara dair karnesi hi&amp;ccedil; i&amp;ccedil; a&amp;ccedil;ıcı değil.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;T&amp;Uuml;İK&amp;#39;in verilerine g&amp;ouml;re &amp;ccedil;ocuklarımızın en az %17&amp;#39;si yetersiz besleniyor. Her 4 &amp;ccedil;ocuktan 1&amp;rsquo;i &amp;ccedil;ocuk a&amp;ccedil;lığı ile karşı karşıya. Zorunlu eğitim &amp;ccedil;ağında olmasına karşın 600 bini aşkın &amp;ccedil;ocuğumuz, eğitim faaliyetlerinin dışındadır. &amp;Ccedil;ok acı bir rakam T&amp;uuml;rkiye&amp;#39;de yoksul &amp;ccedil;ocuk sayısı maalesef 10 milyona yaklaşmış durumda. Peki! Her seferinde 3 &amp;ccedil;ocuk, Şimdilerde yetmez 4 &amp;ccedil;ocuk tavsiyesi veren iktidar bu rakamları d&amp;uuml;zeltme i&amp;ccedil;in hangi adımı atıyor?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:left&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;İktidara g&amp;ouml;re T&amp;uuml;rkiye b&amp;uuml;y&amp;uuml;yor. Ama &amp;ccedil;ocuklarımızın sorunları k&amp;uuml;&amp;ccedil;&amp;uuml;lm&amp;uuml;yor.&amp;nbsp;Karton toplayan &amp;ccedil;ocuklar, ucuz iş g&amp;uuml;c&amp;uuml; olarak &amp;ccedil;alıştırılan &amp;ccedil;ocuklar, renklerinden, dillerinden, engellerinden &amp;ouml;t&amp;uuml;r&amp;uuml; ayrımcılığa maruz kalan &amp;ccedil;ocuklar, istismarın, uyuşturucunun ve &amp;ccedil;etelerin kurbanı olan &amp;ccedil;ocuklar, yırtık ayakkabılarla, delik &amp;ccedil;oraplarla, yarı a&amp;ccedil; okula giden &amp;ccedil;ocuklar, kaldıkları barakada donarak, &amp;ccedil;alıştıkları fabrikada yanarak &amp;ouml;len &amp;ccedil;ocuklar ve yoksulluğun, eşitsizliğin, sefaletin derin denizlerinde yaşama tutunmaya &amp;ccedil;alışan &amp;ccedil;ocuklar.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:left&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Biz buradan s&amp;ouml;z veriyoruz; Bizim iktidarımızda bu &amp;uuml;lkenin &amp;ccedil;ocukları okula a&amp;ccedil; gitmeyecek, şiddetin, istismarın, ihmalin hedefi olmayacak, yoksullukla sınanmayacak.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Bu vesileyle D&amp;uuml;nya &amp;Ccedil;ocuk Hakları G&amp;uuml;n&amp;uuml;&amp;#39;n&amp;uuml; kutluyor; d&amp;uuml;nyadaki t&amp;uuml;m &amp;ccedil;ocukların sağlık, huzur ve barış i&amp;ccedil;erisinde yaşamasını temenni ediyorum.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h1 style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#c00000&quot;&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;_Toc214404403&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;GAZZE&amp;rsquo;Yİ UNUTMAYALIM!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Değerli Arkadaşlar Gazze&amp;rsquo;yi unutmayalım. Gazze&amp;rsquo;de; 10 Ekim&amp;rsquo;de y&amp;uuml;r&amp;uuml;rl&amp;uuml;ğe giren ateşkes bir ayını doldurdu. Bu bir aylık s&amp;uuml;rede Hamas, ateşkese tam olarak bağlı kalmasına rağmen;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;İsrail: aralarında &amp;ccedil;ocukların da olduğu y&amp;uuml;zlerce Filistinliyi katletmeye devam etti. Yardımların sadece 3&amp;rsquo;te1&amp;rsquo;inin Gazze&amp;rsquo;ye girmesine o da rica minnet izin verdi. &amp;Ccedil;ocukların, hastaların ve yaralıların ihtiya&amp;ccedil; duyduğu 350&amp;rsquo;den fazla temel gıda &amp;uuml;r&amp;uuml;n&amp;uuml;n&amp;uuml;n Gazze&amp;rsquo;ye girmesine engel oldu.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&amp;Ouml;n&amp;uuml;m&amp;uuml;z kış! Gazze&amp;rsquo;de ne oturulacak konut var, ne de i&amp;ccedil;inde kalınabilecek sağlam bir &amp;ccedil;adır kalmış durumda. Yağmur mevsiminin başlamasıyla gelen g&amp;ouml;r&amp;uuml;nt&amp;uuml;ler y&amp;uuml;rekleri par&amp;ccedil;alıyor.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Bir kez daha; Gazzeliler ABD&amp;rsquo;nin ve İsrail&amp;rsquo;in insafına terk edilmiş durumda. &amp;ldquo;Ateşkes oldu sorunlar bitti&amp;rdquo; algısıyla; Gazze&amp;rsquo;yi g&amp;uuml;ndemden d&amp;uuml;ş&amp;uuml;rmenin vebali hepimizi yerle bir eder.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Bu algı &amp;uuml;zerinden İsrail ile ilişkileri yeniden normalleştirmeye d&amp;ouml;n&amp;uuml;k ABD&amp;rsquo;nin telkinlerine kayıtsız kalmak bu milletin vicdanını kanatır.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;BİRLEŞMİŞ MİLLET G&amp;Uuml;VENLİK KONSEYİNİN KARARI&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Neden b&amp;ouml;yle bir duruma dikkat &amp;ccedil;ekmek istedik? &amp;Ccedil;&amp;uuml;nk&amp;uuml; &amp;ldquo;İsrail&amp;rsquo;i normalleştirme&amp;rdquo; &amp;ccedil;abaları tam gaz devam ediyor. İki g&amp;uuml;n &amp;ouml;nce, 17 Kasım&amp;rsquo;da; Birleşmiş Milletler G&amp;uuml;venlik Konseyi Gazze&amp;rsquo;deki savaşı sonlandırmayı ve b&amp;ouml;lgede yeni bir d&amp;uuml;zen tesis etmeyi ama&amp;ccedil;layan planı kabul etti.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Uluslararası hukuki stat&amp;uuml;ye haiz bir &amp;ldquo;Barış Kurulu&amp;rdquo; kurulacak. Başkanlığını da Trump yapacakmış! Bu kararların hepsi işin hikaye kısmı; temel hedef: &amp;ldquo;Gazze&amp;rsquo;yi silahsızlandırmak&amp;rdquo; yani Hamas&amp;rsquo;ı Gazze&amp;rsquo;den s&amp;ouml;k&amp;uuml;p atmak.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Ayrıca karar metni, Gazze&amp;rsquo;de toprak ilhakı, kalıcı işgal veya zorunlu yer değiştirme olmayacağını&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;iddia ediyor. Bizim tarihi ve acı tecr&amp;uuml;belerimiz var, kararlar İsrail&amp;rsquo;in ve ABD&amp;rsquo;nin m&amp;uuml;saade ettiği kadar uygulanacaktır.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Bu plan, İsrail i&amp;ccedil;in dikensiz g&amp;uuml;l bah&amp;ccedil;esi oluşturma planıdır. Bu plan, İsrail&amp;rsquo;in soykırım su&amp;ccedil;larını temizleme girişimidir. Sanki 2 yıldan beri on binlerce masum katledilmemiş, Gazze&amp;rsquo;de taş &amp;uuml;st&amp;uuml;nde taş bırakılmamış gibi hareket etmek demektir. Bu plan, Abraham Anlaşmaları yoluyla koruma kalkanının genişletilmesi planıdır. Birleşmiş Milletlerin, 1947&amp;rsquo;deki &amp;ldquo;Filistin Paylaşım Planı&amp;rdquo; b&amp;ouml;lgeye barış getirmedi. 2025&amp;rsquo;teki bu karar da &amp;uuml;mit edilen sonu&amp;ccedil;ları doğurmayacaktır.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Vicdan sahibi &amp;uuml;lkeler; bu ger&amp;ccedil;eği unutmamalı, &amp;ldquo;g&amp;uuml;n&amp;rdquo; ile birlikte &amp;ldquo;geleceği&amp;rdquo; de kurtarmanın yollarını mutlaka bulmalıdır.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;SON İKİ HAFTADA BEYAZ SARAY&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Bu arada bu planın ger&amp;ccedil;ekleşmesi i&amp;ccedil;in Trump ve Beyaz Saray yoğun bir mesai i&amp;ccedil;erisinde. Eyl&amp;uuml;l ayında, &amp;ldquo;Sandalye &amp;ccedil;ekmeli&amp;rdquo; Beyaz Saray zirvesini hepimiz hatırlıyoruz. Bunun &amp;uuml;st&amp;uuml;ne &amp;ccedil;ok&amp;ccedil;a yazıldı, konuşuldu. İki hafta &amp;ouml;nce; Orta Asya &amp;ndash; ABD zirvesinde; Kazakistan da maalesef İsrail ile normalleşme s&amp;uuml;recini başlattı ve Abraham Anlaşmalarına imza attı.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Yetmedi, ge&amp;ccedil;tiğimiz hafta Suriye Cumhurbaşkanı Ahmet eş-Şara Beyaz Saraya gitti. Yan kapıdan i&amp;ccedil;eri alınan eş-Şara &amp;ouml;n kapıdan, parf&amp;uuml;mlerle uğurlandı.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;BEYAZ SARAY&amp;rsquo;DA AĞIRLANMANIN BEDELİ VARDIR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Beyaz Saray&amp;rsquo;da ağırlanmanın bedeli vardır.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;ABD ile m&amp;uuml;ttefik olmanın yolu işgalci İsrail ile dost olmaktan ge&amp;ccedil;er. ABD ile m&amp;uuml;ttefik olmanın yolu &amp;uuml;lkenizde bulunan nadir toprak elementlerini,&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;uranyum yataklarını ve enerji kaynaklarını Amerika ve İsrail sermayesine a&amp;ccedil;maktan ge&amp;ccedil;er.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;margin-left:36px; text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Bu ortaklıktan sizin payınıza d&amp;uuml;şen ise tırnak i&amp;ccedil;erisinde s&amp;ouml;yl&amp;uuml;yorum, adı el&amp;ccedil;i olan ama b&amp;ouml;lgenin hamiliğine soyunan hadsizin dilinden d&amp;ouml;k&amp;uuml;len &amp;ldquo;Meşruiyet&amp;rdquo; lakırdısıdır.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;BARRACK M&amp;Uuml;TEVAZI KONUŞMUŞ&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;T&amp;uuml;m bunlardan sonra;&amp;nbsp;&amp;ldquo;Hazar Denizi&amp;rsquo;nden Akdeniz&amp;rsquo;e kadar bir hizalanma g&amp;ouml;receksiniz.&amp;rdquo;&amp;nbsp;Diyen Tom Barrack&amp;rsquo;ın Aslında son derece m&amp;uuml;tevazı bir şekilde konuşmuş olduğunu anladık. Hedefin &amp;ccedil;ok daha b&amp;uuml;y&amp;uuml;k olduğunu g&amp;ouml;r&amp;uuml;yoruz.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;T&amp;Uuml;RKİYE BU İŞİN NERESİNDE?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Şimdi biz sormak zorundayız: Dostum diye paye verdikleriniz ne işler &amp;ccedil;eviriyor? Amerika: T&amp;uuml;rkiye&amp;rsquo;nin parasını &amp;ouml;dediği F-35&amp;rsquo;leri vermiyor, Caatsa yaptırımları olduğu gibi duruyor, her g&amp;uuml;n bir lideri ağırlayarak b&amp;ouml;lgeyi dizayn etmeye &amp;ccedil;alışıyor. Peki; T&amp;uuml;rkiye bu işlerin neresinde duruyor? Sorunun cevabı bu kez, Turkcell&amp;rsquo;den geldi.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;TURKCELL&amp;rsquo;IN GOOGLE&amp;rsquo;LA ANLAŞMASI&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Hepinizin malumu; Turkcell, T&amp;uuml;rkiye Varlık Fonu&amp;rsquo;nun ciddi oranda pay sahibi olduğu, yani b&amp;uuml;y&amp;uuml;k oranda devlet kontrol&amp;uuml;nde bulunan bir şirket. Turkcell&amp;rsquo;in attığı her adım -hele ki- veri g&amp;uuml;venliğiyle ilgili olan adımlar doğrudan T&amp;uuml;rkiye&amp;rsquo;nin g&amp;uuml;venliğine ve geleceğine ilişkindir.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Turkcell ile Google arasında yerel bir bulut altyapısı kurulması i&amp;ccedil;in 1 milyar dolarlık bir anlaşma imzalandı.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;T&amp;uuml;rkiye&amp;rsquo;nin kendi verisini bu şirkete teslim etmeye y&amp;ouml;nelmesi; dış politika, ulusal g&amp;uuml;venlik ve siyasi tutarlılık a&amp;ccedil;ısından vahim bir hatadır. Bazıları diyebilir ki: &amp;ldquo;Bug&amp;uuml;n, Google bu verileri kullanmaz.&amp;rdquo; Peki yarın? ABD&amp;ndash;T&amp;uuml;rkiye ilişkilerinin gerildiği bir senaryoda ne olur? Halkbank dosyası ve Reza Zarrab s&amp;uuml;recleri bize; ABD&amp;rsquo;nin verileri nasıl bir koz, hatta şantaj unsuru olarak kullandığını &amp;ccedil;ok net g&amp;ouml;sterdi.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Biz; T&amp;uuml;rkiye&amp;rsquo;den İsrail&amp;rsquo;e giden petrol&amp;uuml;n kesilmesini beklerken, iktidar &amp;uuml;lkenin en hassas verilerini İsrail&amp;rsquo;le işbirlik&amp;ccedil;iliği konusunda derin ş&amp;uuml;pheler bulunan Google&amp;rsquo;a, tarihin en b&amp;uuml;y&amp;uuml;k bilişim maliyeti ile aktarmaya &amp;ccedil;alışıyor.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Bu anlaşma; ulusal g&amp;uuml;venliğe de veri egemenliğine aykırıdır. Ne yerlidir nede millidir. Daha d&amp;uuml;n L&amp;uuml;bnan&amp;rsquo;da ve İran&amp;rsquo;da yaşanan saldırılar g&amp;ouml;z&amp;uuml;m&amp;uuml;z&amp;uuml;n &amp;ouml;n&amp;uuml;nde. Biz iktidarı, şimdiden uyarıyoruz!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Bug&amp;uuml;n Amerika&amp;rsquo;nın ve İsrail&amp;rsquo;in eline kendi ellerimizle verdiğimiz veriler;&amp;nbsp;Yarın bize ciddi bir tehdit ve tehlike olarak d&amp;ouml;nebilir!&amp;nbsp;Bunun olmasına izin vermeyin!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h1 style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#c00000&quot;&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;_Toc214404404&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;TER&amp;Ouml;RS&amp;Uuml;Z T&amp;Uuml;RKİYE&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;G&amp;uuml;ndemin &amp;ouml;nemli başlıklarından birisi, İmralı tartışmaları. Bug&amp;uuml;n; İktidarın tek g&amp;uuml;ndemi İmralı. Ana muhalefetin tek g&amp;uuml;ndemi Silivri. T&amp;uuml;rkiye&amp;rsquo;nin sorunları da, umutları da İmralı&amp;rsquo;dan da Silivri&amp;rsquo;den de b&amp;uuml;y&amp;uuml;kt&amp;uuml;r!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Kimin gideceği, kimin geleceği, kimlerle gidip, kimlerle d&amp;ouml;neceği, neyle gidip, neyle geleceği hangi yolu kullanacağı, g&amp;uuml;ndemi meşgul etme &amp;ccedil;abasıdır.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Meseleyi kişilere indirgemek, sulandırmak, magazinleştirmek, g&amp;uuml;ndem saptırmaktan başka bir şey değildir.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h1 style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#c00000&quot;&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;_Toc214404405&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;TOPLUMSAL DESTEĞİ ARTIRMA &amp;Ccedil;ABASI&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Buradan en başta iktidara, t&amp;uuml;m ortaklarına İmralı&amp;rsquo;ya gidip gelen heyetlere ve Milli Dayanışma, Kardeşlik ve Demokrasi Komisyonuna sesleniyoruz; toplumun farklı kesimlerinin&amp;nbsp;kaygılarını ve&amp;nbsp;endişelerini gidermek, beklentilerini&amp;nbsp;ve umutlarını&amp;nbsp;karşılamak&amp;nbsp;i&amp;ccedil;in m&amp;uuml;cadele etmek. Topyekun&amp;nbsp;bir helalleşme ve kucaklaşma gerektirirken&amp;nbsp;s&amp;uuml;recin&amp;nbsp;bir &amp;ouml;rg&amp;uuml;t&amp;uuml;n silah bırakmasına ve kendini&amp;nbsp;feshetmesine indirgenmesini yanlış bulmak;&amp;nbsp;İşi&amp;nbsp;yokuşa s&amp;uuml;rmek değildir!&amp;nbsp;Tam aksine;&amp;nbsp;s&amp;uuml;rece&amp;nbsp;olan toplumsal desteği artırma &amp;ccedil;abasıdır!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h1 style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h1&gt;

&lt;h1 style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#c00000&quot;&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;_Toc214404406&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;B&amp;Uuml;T&amp;Uuml;N BU TARTIŞMALAR OYALAMACADIR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&amp;ldquo;Komisyon mu İmralı&amp;rsquo;ya gitsin? İmralı&amp;nbsp;mı Komisyon&amp;rsquo;a gelsin?&amp;rdquo;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;b&amp;uuml;t&amp;uuml;n&amp;nbsp;bu tartışmalar oyalamacadır. Toplumsal bir barış i&amp;ccedil;in tek bir adım değil, gerekli t&amp;uuml;m adımlar&amp;nbsp;hak&amp;nbsp;ve adalet ekseninde&amp;nbsp;atılmalıdır ve bir an evvel atılmalıdır.&amp;nbsp;Hak ve &amp;ouml;zg&amp;uuml;rl&amp;uuml;kler &amp;uuml;zerindeki&amp;nbsp;t&amp;uuml;m&amp;nbsp;kısıtlamalar bir&amp;nbsp;an evvel kaldırılmalıdır. İlk olarak;&amp;nbsp;Anayasa Mahkemesi&amp;rsquo;nin ve Avrupa İnsan Hakları Mahkemesi&amp;rsquo;nin&amp;nbsp;bağlayıcı&amp;nbsp;kararlarına uyulmalıdır.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Tekrar s&amp;ouml;yl&amp;uuml;yorum; Ter&amp;ouml;rs&amp;uuml;z T&amp;uuml;rkiye&amp;rsquo;yi kurmak i&amp;ccedil;in elimizi değil, g&amp;ouml;vdemizi taşın altına koymaya hazırız.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Ama &amp;ldquo;Hukuksuz T&amp;uuml;rkiye&amp;rsquo;yi&amp;rdquo; ortadan kaldırmak g&amp;uuml;c&amp;uuml;n değil, hukukun egemen olduğu bir T&amp;uuml;rkiye&amp;rsquo;yi kurmak i&amp;ccedil;in de&amp;nbsp;aynı kararlılığı ortaya koymalıyız.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h1 style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#c00000&quot;&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;_Toc214404407&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;GİTMESİ VE GELMESİ GEREKENLER&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;İmralı&amp;rsquo;ya gitmeyi, İmralı&amp;rsquo;yla g&amp;ouml;r&amp;uuml;şmeyi bu kadar &amp;ouml;nemseyenler i&amp;ccedil;in s&amp;ouml;yl&amp;uuml;yorum:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;T&amp;uuml;rkiye&amp;rsquo;de gidilmesi gereken, g&amp;ouml;r&amp;uuml;ş&amp;uuml;lmesi gereken, olması gerektiği yerde olmayan o kadar &amp;ccedil;ok kesim var ki.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Mesela! Sadece bir tweet attığı i&amp;ccedil;in tutuklanan gazeteciler, artık gazetelerine gitmelidir.&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Su&amp;ccedil;suz yere cezaevinde tutulan harp okulu &amp;ouml;ğrencileri artık&amp;nbsp;evlerine gitmelidir.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Barış Akademisyenleri,&amp;nbsp;yeniden k&amp;uuml;rs&amp;uuml;lerine gitmelidir.&amp;nbsp;KHK zulm&amp;uuml;yle işinden uzaklaştırılanlar, yeniden&amp;nbsp;işlerine gitmelidir.&amp;nbsp;Sendikal hakkını kullandığı i&amp;ccedil;in cezalandırılan iş&amp;ccedil;iler,&amp;nbsp;fabrikalarına gitmelidir.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Toplumsal barış ve huzurun, toplumun t&amp;uuml;m kesimlerinin, ekonomik, k&amp;uuml;lt&amp;uuml;rel, sosyal ve siyasal a&amp;ccedil;ıdan kendilerini iyi hissetmesi ile m&amp;uuml;mk&amp;uuml;n olacağı unutulmamalıdır.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h1 style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#c00000&quot;&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;_Toc214404408&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;HUKUKSUZ T&amp;Uuml;RKİYE&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Şunu &amp;ccedil;ok net bir şekilde s&amp;ouml;ylemek zorundayız: Hukuksuz bir T&amp;uuml;rkiye ile ter&amp;ouml;rs&amp;uuml;z bir T&amp;uuml;rkiye&amp;rsquo;yi inşa edemezsiniz. Hukuksuz bir T&amp;uuml;rkiye ile yaşanabilir bir T&amp;uuml;rkiye inşa edemezsiniz.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h1 style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#c00000&quot;&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;_Toc214404409&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;ANAYASA MAHKEMESİNİN KARARI&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Şu an i&amp;ccedil;erisinde bulunduğumuz Meclis&amp;rsquo;i de ilgilendiren bir &amp;ouml;rnek vereceğim: 11 Kasım&amp;rsquo;da Resmi Gazetede, bir Anayasa Mahkemesi Kararı yayımlandı. Bu karar; T&amp;uuml;rkiye&amp;rsquo;de &amp;ldquo;yasama &amp;ccedil;oğunluğunun&amp;rdquo; hukuki denetimden &amp;ldquo;muaf&amp;rdquo; hale gelmesinin &amp;ouml;n&amp;uuml;n&amp;uuml; a&amp;ccedil;ıyor. B&amp;ouml;ylece; meclis &amp;ccedil;oğunluğunun keyfiliğini frenleyen az sayıdaki g&amp;uuml;vence mekanizmasından biri daha ortadan kalkmış oldu.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;AK Parti Grubu şunu diyor:&amp;nbsp;&amp;ldquo;Biz sayıca &amp;ccedil;oğunluğuz, istediğimizi yaparız, bu durum Anayasa mahkemesini ilgilendirmez&amp;rdquo;diyor. Bizim &amp;ldquo;Hukuksuz T&amp;uuml;rkiye&amp;rdquo;den kastımız tam olarak budur!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h1 style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#c00000&quot;&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;_Toc214404410&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;ADALETİN NURUNU S&amp;Ouml;ND&amp;Uuml;REN, NARINDA YANACAKTIR.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Ge&amp;ccedil;en hafta; Anayasa Mahkemesi Başkanı Kadir &amp;Ouml;zkaya&amp;rsquo;nın yaptığı bir konuşmada hakimliğin,&amp;nbsp;bir tarafı &amp;ldquo;nur&amp;rdquo; yani cennet, bir tarafı &amp;ldquo;nar&amp;rdquo; yani cehennem arasında bir meslek&amp;nbsp;olduğunu s&amp;ouml;ylerken d&amp;ouml;kt&amp;uuml;ğ&amp;uuml; g&amp;ouml;zyaşlarını izledik.&amp;nbsp;&amp;Ccedil;ok doğru! Adaletin nurunu s&amp;ouml;nd&amp;uuml;ren, narında yanacaktır.&amp;nbsp;Bir insanın, yaptığı meslekten &amp;ouml;t&amp;uuml;r&amp;uuml; taşıdığı hassasiyet elbette takdire şayandır.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Ancak, şu an bu &amp;uuml;lkenin en b&amp;uuml;y&amp;uuml;k ihtiyacı; toplumun &amp;ouml;n&amp;uuml;nde g&amp;ouml;zyaşları d&amp;ouml;ken, &amp;ccedil;aresiz bir mahkeme başkanı değil, hukuksuzluğa karşı dimdik duran yargı mensuplarıdır.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Bu &amp;uuml;lkede; hala Anayasa Mahkemesi&amp;rsquo;nin ve Avrupa İnsan Hakları Mahkemesi&amp;rsquo;nin Kararları tanınmıyor. Selahattin Demirtaş,&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Osman Kavala ve Can Atalay hakkında verilen bağlayıcı kararların uygulanmaması &amp;ldquo;Hukuksuz T&amp;uuml;rkiye&amp;rdquo; s&amp;uuml;recinin devam etmekte olduğunu g&amp;ouml;steriyor. Anayasa Mahkemesi kararına rağmen&amp;nbsp;şehir&amp;nbsp;plancısı&amp;nbsp;Tayfun Kahraman&amp;rsquo;ın tahliye edilmemesi &amp;ldquo;Hukuksuz T&amp;uuml;rkiye&amp;rdquo; s&amp;uuml;recinin devam etmekte olduğunu g&amp;ouml;steriyor.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:left&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h1 style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#c00000&quot;&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;_Toc214404411&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;MUHALEFET &amp;Uuml;ZERİNDEN DEVAM EDEN TARTIŞMALAR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Bug&amp;uuml;n ana muhalefet partisi hakkında &amp;ldquo;kapatma davasının&amp;rdquo; konuşuluyor olması T&amp;uuml;rkiye&amp;rsquo;nin hukuk konusunda, adalet konusunda onlarca yıldır h&amp;acirc;l&amp;acirc; aynı yerde d&amp;ouml;n&amp;uuml;p durduğunun ispatıdır. Kurduğumuz 5 partinin 4&amp;rsquo;&amp;uuml;n&amp;uuml;n kapatıldığı 56 yıllık bir hareketin mensupları olarak s&amp;ouml;yl&amp;uuml;yoruz:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&amp;ldquo;parti kapatmaları&amp;rdquo;,&amp;nbsp;siyaseti zehirlemekten&amp;nbsp;başka bir şey değildir.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Binlerce sayfalık iddianameler, parti kapatmaları, şafak operasyonları ve tutuklamalar aziz milletimizin maalesef yabancısı olduğu bir durum değil.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Ge&amp;ccedil;mişte; &amp;ldquo;Şiir okudu&amp;rdquo; diye Sn. Erdoğan&amp;rsquo;ı hapse atmak ne kadar yanlışsa, Bug&amp;uuml;n de Sn. İmamoğlu&amp;rsquo;nun &amp;ldquo;sosyal medya hesaplarını bir ayda 3 kez kapatmak&amp;rdquo; aynı derecede yanlıştır. Bizler Ergenekon Balyoz d&amp;ouml;neminde de binlerce sayfalık iddianameleri takip etmiştik, AK Parti&amp;rsquo;ye karşı a&amp;ccedil;ılan kapatma davasını da g&amp;ouml;rm&amp;uuml;şt&amp;uuml;k. Kapatmalar, dayatmalar, engellemeler, bunu yapanlara hi&amp;ccedil;bir fayda sağlamamıştır. Ama &amp;uuml;lkeye &amp;ccedil;ok şey kaybettirmiştir.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Biz bu durumu 28 Şubat s&amp;uuml;recinde tecr&amp;uuml;be ettik. Şimdi CHP&amp;rsquo;nin yaşadıkları da aynı&amp;nbsp;s&amp;uuml;reci deneyimlemektedir. Bug&amp;uuml;n de kaybeden T&amp;uuml;rkiye&amp;rsquo;dir, 86 milyon insanımızdır. T&amp;uuml;rkiye&amp;rsquo;nin ciddi, &amp;ccedil;ok ciddi başka meseleleri vardır.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h1 style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#c00000&quot;&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;_Toc214404412&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;

&lt;h1 style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#c00000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;AİLE YILI VE BUNU ANLAMLI KILMAK&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:left&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Ekonomiye birazdan geleceğim, g&amp;uuml;ndemde olduğu i&amp;ccedil;in &amp;ldquo;Aileye&amp;rdquo; değinmek istiyorum. Hatırlayacaksınız; iktidar 2025 yılını &amp;ldquo;Aile Yılı&amp;rdquo; ilan etmişti. Aile yılının, on birinci ayını da t&amp;uuml;ketiyoruz. Bundan dolayı olacak ki; bug&amp;uuml;n ve yarın başkentimizde cumhurbaşkanlığı &amp;ldquo;Aile ve K&amp;uuml;lt&amp;uuml;r Sanat Sempozyumu&amp;rdquo; d&amp;uuml;zenliyor.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:left&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:left&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Aile yılı ilan edildiğinde, yine bu k&amp;uuml;rs&amp;uuml;den &amp;ldquo;Yapacağınız b&amp;uuml;t&amp;uuml;n yapısal &amp;ccedil;alışmaların yanında oluruz&amp;rdquo; demiş ve eklemiştik:&amp;nbsp;Bu mesele;&amp;nbsp;ışıltılı salonlarda yapılan Aile lansmanlarıyla &amp;ccedil;&amp;ouml;z&amp;uuml;lmez. Kamera &amp;ouml;n&amp;uuml;nde umut dağıtmakla &amp;ccedil;&amp;ouml;z&amp;uuml;lmez samimi icraatlarla, doğru politikalarla &amp;ccedil;&amp;ouml;z&amp;uuml;l&amp;uuml;r!&amp;nbsp;Demiştik. Hala aynı noktadayız!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:left&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:left&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Aileyi g&amp;uuml;&amp;ccedil;lendirmenin yolu en başta hayat pahalılığını, ahlakı &amp;ccedil;&amp;ouml;kerten yayınları kaldırmaktan adaletsizliği &amp;ccedil;&amp;ouml;zmekten ge&amp;ccedil;er. Aile Yılı&amp;rsquo;nı anlamlı kılacak tek şey, ailelerin yaşadığı derin sorunlarla y&amp;uuml;zleşmek ve ekonomi-politiği buna g&amp;ouml;re belirlemektir.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h1 style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#c00000&quot;&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;_Toc214404413&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;

&lt;h1 style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#c00000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;YOKSULLARIN EKONOMİSİ&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:left&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Siz Aile Yılı&amp;rsquo;nı parf&amp;uuml;m fabrikası yangınında ailesinden &amp;uuml;&amp;ccedil; can yitiren Berivan Taşdemir&amp;rsquo;e sorun!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&amp;ldquo;&amp;Ccedil;ocuk yaşta, sigortasız bir işte niye &amp;ccedil;alışıyordunuz?&amp;rdquo;&amp;nbsp;sorusuna ağlayarak cevap veren&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:left&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Berivan şunları s&amp;ouml;yl&amp;uuml;yor:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&amp;ldquo;Devir &amp;ccedil;ok zor. Bir ekmek olmuş 15 lira. İnsanlar yaşayamıyor, ge&amp;ccedil;im sağlayamıyor. Nereye baksan her şey pahalı İnsan ne yapsın?&amp;rdquo;&amp;nbsp;diyor&amp;hellip;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:left&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h1 style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#c00000&quot;&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;_Toc214404414&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;ASGARİ &amp;Uuml;CRETLİ İLE FABRİKAT&amp;Ouml;R&amp;Uuml;N HİKAYESİ AYNI&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:left&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Berivan&amp;rsquo;ın g&amp;ouml;zyaşlarında sadece kendi hik&amp;acirc;yesi yok; bu &amp;uuml;lkenin yoksulunun da, &amp;ccedil;ift&amp;ccedil;isinin de, esnafının da ortak acısı var. Mesele sadece bir kişinin, bir ailenin dramı değil; mesele T&amp;uuml;rkiye&amp;rsquo;nin her kesimini sıkıştıran ekonomik kriz.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:left&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:left&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Sofrasına ekmek koyamayan aile ile &amp;uuml;retimini s&amp;uuml;rd&amp;uuml;remeyen fabrikat&amp;ouml;r arasındaki mesafe sanıldığı kadar b&amp;uuml;y&amp;uuml;k değil. Biri evine ekmek g&amp;ouml;t&amp;uuml;remiyor, diğeri; onlarca, y&amp;uuml;zlerce &amp;ccedil;alışanının olduğu işletmesinde maaşları &amp;ouml;deyemiyor. Aynı ekonomik buhranın iki y&amp;uuml;z&amp;uuml; budur!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h1 style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#c00000&quot;&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;_Toc214404415&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;

&lt;h1 style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#c00000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;İNSANLARIMIZIN FERYADI&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Bu hafta; &amp;uuml;retimin merkezlerinden Antalya ve Kayseri, ticaretin merkezi İstanbul sanayinin merkezi &amp;Ccedil;orlu&amp;rsquo;daydık. &amp;Ccedil;ift&amp;ccedil;imiz feryat ediyor. &amp;Ccedil;orlu&amp;rsquo;da &amp;ccedil;ift&amp;ccedil;imiz diyor ki:&amp;nbsp;&amp;ldquo;Borcumuzu &amp;ouml;demek i&amp;ccedil;in tarlamızı sattık. Kendi tarlamızda kiracı olduk. Şimdi de kirayı &amp;ouml;deyemediğimiz i&amp;ccedil;in icralık olduk!&amp;rdquo; diyor&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Esnaf feryat ediyor, K&amp;uuml;&amp;ccedil;&amp;uuml;k işletmeci feryat ediyor. Fabrika sahibi iş insanları ile konuşuyoruz oda feryat ediyor.&amp;nbsp;&amp;ldquo;B&amp;ouml;yle giderse 6 ay sonra &amp;uuml;retimi durdurup, fabrikayı kapatmak zorunda kalacağız&amp;rdquo;&amp;nbsp;diyorlar.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Burada sadece Tekstil&amp;rsquo;den &amp;ouml;rnek vereceğim: 2022&amp;rsquo;den bu yana tekstil ve hazır giyimde toplam 336 bin 847 kişi işini kaybetti. Son 3 yılda sekt&amp;ouml;rdeki toplam istihdam kaybı %27&amp;rsquo;yi bulmuş durumda. Sekt&amp;ouml;r temsilcilerine g&amp;ouml;re 2026 yılı ortasına kadar 100 bin kişi daha işini kaybedebilir.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;T&amp;uuml;rkiye&amp;rsquo;de pazar kaybeden ve ekonomik kriz y&amp;uuml;z&amp;uuml;nden &amp;uuml;retim yapamayan fabrikalar bir bir Mısır&amp;rsquo;a, Tunus&amp;rsquo;a, Fas&amp;rsquo;a taşınıyor.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Bu sekt&amp;ouml;rleri ve sekt&amp;ouml;rlerin rakamlarını &amp;ccedil;oğaltabiliriz.&amp;nbsp;Bunun karşısında bir de iktidarın rakamları var.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h1 style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#c00000&quot;&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;_Toc214404416&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;İKTİDARIN RAKAMLARI&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;İktidarda diyor ki: Atıl işg&amp;uuml;c&amp;uuml; oranında, ge&amp;ccedil;en &amp;ccedil;eyreğe g&amp;ouml;re %2,6 azalış var. D&amp;uuml;nyanın en b&amp;uuml;y&amp;uuml;k 17&amp;rsquo;nci, Avrupa&amp;rsquo;nın 7&amp;rsquo;nci ekonomisi haline geldik. Kişi başına d&amp;uuml;şen milli gelir 17.000 dolara ulaştı. Kimse kusura bakmasın! T&amp;uuml;rkiye&amp;rsquo;deki ger&amp;ccedil;ek ekonomi rakamlarını g&amp;ouml;rmek isteyenler, d&amp;ouml;n&amp;uuml;p sahaya baksın. Bu hafta Kayseri&amp;rsquo;de, Antalya&amp;rsquo;da, &amp;Ccedil;orlu&amp;rsquo;da g&amp;ouml;rd&amp;uuml;ğ&amp;uuml;m manzara, bu s&amp;ouml;ylenenlerin tam aksini anlatıyor.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h1 style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#c00000&quot;&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;_Toc214404417&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;ASGAR&amp;Icirc; &amp;Uuml;CRET&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Gelir adaletsizliğinin bu kadar yaygın olduğu bir d&amp;ouml;nemde, &amp;ldquo;&amp;ccedil;alışabilen&amp;rdquo; milyonlarca insanımızın&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;hangi koşullarda &amp;ccedil;alıştığı da karşımıza acı bir ger&amp;ccedil;ek olarak &amp;ccedil;ıkıyor. T&amp;uuml;rkiye&amp;rsquo;de ve d&amp;uuml;nyada, yapılan bir işte verilmesi gereken taban fiyatı ifade eden asgar&amp;icirc; &amp;uuml;cret; bug&amp;uuml;n T&amp;uuml;rkiye&amp;rsquo;de &amp;ldquo;temel &amp;uuml;cret&amp;rdquo; haline geldi.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&amp;Ouml;yle ki bug&amp;uuml;n işe yeni başlayan biri de asgar&amp;icirc; &amp;uuml;cret alıyor, on yıllık iş&amp;ccedil;i de asgar&amp;icirc; &amp;uuml;cret alıyor. Bakınız: T&amp;uuml;rkiye&amp;rsquo;de 2024 yılında 11.2 milyon insanımız asgar&amp;icirc; &amp;uuml;cretle &amp;ccedil;alışmış. 21 Avrupa &amp;uuml;lkesinin tamamında asgar&amp;icirc; &amp;uuml;cretle &amp;ccedil;alışan kişi sayısı ne kadar biliyor musunuz? 12.8 milyon. Yani T&amp;uuml;rkiye&amp;rsquo;de asgar&amp;icirc; &amp;uuml;cretle &amp;ccedil;alışan kişi sayısı neredeyse Avrupa&amp;rsquo;nın tamamına eşit durumda.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Değerli arkadaşlar, bu &amp;uuml;lkede asgari &amp;uuml;cret 22.104 TL, a&amp;ccedil;lık sınırı 28.412 TL. &amp;Uuml;z&amp;uuml;lerek s&amp;ouml;yl&amp;uuml;yorum, bu a&amp;ccedil;lık sınırı değil, yoksulluk sınırı hi&amp;ccedil; değil bu iktidarın bu rakamları &amp;ldquo;&amp;ouml;l&amp;uuml;m sınırı&amp;rdquo; olmuş durumda.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h1 style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#c00000&quot;&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;_Toc214404418&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;VATANDAŞ BOR&amp;Ccedil;LU&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;T&amp;uuml;m bu adaletsiz gelir dağılımı, temel &amp;uuml;cret politikası, hayat pahalılığı karşında vatandaşımız, &amp;ccedil;areyi bor&amp;ccedil;lanmakta buluyor. Bug&amp;uuml;n iş insanlarımız bor&amp;ccedil;lu, esnaf bor&amp;ccedil;lu, &amp;ccedil;ift&amp;ccedil;i bor&amp;ccedil;lu, asgar&amp;icirc; &amp;uuml;cretli bor&amp;ccedil;lu. T&amp;uuml;rkiye bor&amp;ccedil;lu!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h1 style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#c00000&quot;&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;_Toc214404419&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;TARİHİ GE&amp;Ccedil;MİŞ H&amp;Uuml;K&amp;Uuml;MET&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Nasıl bir vurdumduymazlıktır ki en temel noktalarda bile gıda konusunda bile denetimsizlik hat safhada:&amp;nbsp;Lokantalar &amp;ouml;l&amp;uuml;m kusuyor.&amp;nbsp;İnsanlarımız ailesiyle nefes almak i&amp;ccedil;in &amp;ccedil;ıktığı evlerinden son nefesini verip ana haber olarak&amp;nbsp;d&amp;ouml;n&amp;uuml;yorlar.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Neredeyse her g&amp;uuml;n intiharla uyanıyoruz. Kupon gibi yandaşlara dağıtılan haber ajanslarınız doğalgazdan, u&amp;ccedil;an arabalara kadar haftada &amp;uuml;&amp;ccedil; g&amp;uuml;n&amp;nbsp;m&amp;uuml;jde dağıtırken; liyakat sahibi insanlarımız ya&amp;nbsp;AVM&amp;rsquo;lerin y&amp;uuml;ksek katlarından kendini &amp;ouml;l&amp;uuml;me bırakıyor ya da&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;Marmaray&amp;rsquo;ın&amp;nbsp;raylarına kendilerini bırakıyorlar.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Bu g&amp;uuml;zel milletimizin psikolojisi de sosyolojisi de t&amp;uuml;kenmiştir. İktidarınızı desteklemeyen insanlar neredeyse 10 yıldır asla kamuda istihdam edilmiyor! Bırakın beyaz yakalıları, artık masalar sandalyeler, kamu demirbaşları bile liyakat diye &amp;ccedil;ığlık atıyorlar.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Sistematik olarak dozu artırılan medya prod&amp;uuml;ksiyonlarıyla şiddet had safhada, bahis kumar almış başını&amp;nbsp;gitmiş. &amp;Ouml;yle bir&amp;nbsp;Amerikan&amp;nbsp;r&amp;uuml;yasına kapıldınız ki şiddet olaylarında Texas&amp;#39;ı, kumarda&amp;nbsp;Las Vegas&amp;#39;ı&amp;nbsp;bile solladınız. T&amp;uuml;m bu yıkımın tek sorumlusu vardır o da&amp;nbsp;tarihi ge&amp;ccedil;miş h&amp;uuml;k&amp;uuml;mettir!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h1 style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#c00000&quot;&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;_Toc214404420&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;ASLAN, CEYLAN, SIRTLAN, ZEBRA YAN YANA KOŞUYORSA&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Bir Afrika atas&amp;ouml;z&amp;uuml; vardır:&amp;nbsp;&amp;ldquo;Aslan, ceylan, zebra yan yana koşuyorsa, orman yanıyor demektir!&amp;rdquo;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Bug&amp;uuml;n T&amp;uuml;rkiye&amp;rsquo;de iş&amp;ccedil;i de, işveren de; gazeteci de, medya patronu da; &amp;ouml;ğrenci de, akademisyen de; &amp;ccedil;ift&amp;ccedil;i de, esnaf da; asgar&amp;icirc; &amp;uuml;cretli de, memur da; muhalif de veya iktidar se&amp;ccedil;meni de; herkes feryat ediyor.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&amp;Ccedil;&amp;uuml;nk&amp;uuml;!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Bu orman, yanıyor arkadaşlar, T&amp;uuml;rkiye &amp;ccedil;ok b&amp;uuml;y&amp;uuml;k bir ekonomik krizle yanıyor!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h1 style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#c00000&quot;&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;_Toc214404421&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;ORMAN B&amp;Ouml;YLE YANIYOR!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Bu orman nasıl yanıyor size anlatayım: D&amp;uuml;nyanın ilk 10 ekonomisi arasına girecektik; organize su&amp;ccedil;larda ilk 10&amp;rsquo;a girdik! Faiz bitecekti; Avrupa&amp;rsquo;da ilk sıraya geldik. Enflasyon bitecekti, d&amp;uuml;nyada beşinci sıradayız. Kira konut endeksinde birinci sıradayız. Gıda enflasyonunda birinci sıradayız. Avrupa&amp;#39;ya sığınmacı başvurusunda bulunan &amp;uuml;lkeler arasında Suriye, Afganistan ve Venezuela&amp;#39;nın ardından 4. Sıradayız&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;İşte orman b&amp;ouml;yle yanıyor! İşte vatandaşlarımız bunun i&amp;ccedil;in feryat ediyor, İşte T&amp;uuml;rkiye bunun i&amp;ccedil;in kaybediyor. Biz; bu yangını s&amp;ouml;nd&amp;uuml;receğiz arkadaşlar! Biz bu yangını s&amp;ouml;nd&amp;uuml;rmek i&amp;ccedil;in bug&amp;uuml;ne kadar olduğu gibi bundan sonra canla başla &amp;ccedil;alışmaya devam edeceğiz.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h1 style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#c00000&quot;&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;_Toc214404422&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;DUS MAĞDURU DİŞ HEKİMLERİ&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Bug&amp;uuml;n, grup toplantımız vesile ile Diş Hekimliği Fak&amp;uuml;ltesi mezunu gen&amp;ccedil;lerimizin sesi olmak istiyorum. Yeni a&amp;ccedil;ıklanan &amp;Ouml;SYM takvimine g&amp;ouml;re yılda iki kez yapılması planlanan DUS sınavı teke d&amp;uuml;ş&amp;uuml;r&amp;uuml;lm&amp;uuml;ş ve tam 7 ay ertelenmiştir. İşlerini bırakıp, hayatlarını bu sınava g&amp;ouml;re planlayan binlerce gencimiz var.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Bu gen&amp;ccedil;ler, &amp;uuml;lkesine daha fazla fayda sağlamak i&amp;ccedil;in 5 yıllık eğitimlerinin &amp;uuml;zerine 3&amp;ndash;4 yıl daha koyarak uzmanlaşmak isteyen idealist gen&amp;ccedil;ler. Niyetleri k&amp;ouml;t&amp;uuml; değil, talepleri aşırı değil. Sadece emeklerinin heba edilmemesini istiyorlar.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Diş hekimi adayı gen&amp;ccedil;lerimizin itibarından tasarruf edilmesine karşıyız. DUS&amp;rsquo;a ihtiya&amp;ccedil; olduğu aşikar. Bunu temin etmek, gen&amp;ccedil;lerimizin hayat planları i&amp;ccedil;in kıymetli. İktidar doğru bir planlama ile bunu ger&amp;ccedil;ekleştirmelidir. Bu &amp;uuml;lkenin parlak hekimlerini k&amp;uuml;st&amp;uuml;rmeyin. Gen&amp;ccedil;lerimizi belirsizliğe mahk&amp;ucirc;m etmeyin.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Bu duygu ve d&amp;uuml;ş&amp;uuml;ncelerle s&amp;ouml;zlerimi bitiriyor, hepinizi h&amp;uuml;rmet ve muhabbetle selamlıyorum.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

